From d26f1e022f252b2efe2a4c9b38fed6be218c56ec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lotus Developer <dev@lotus.org>
Date: Thu, 16 Apr 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] rpc: add lock-free RCU chain and mempool snapshot

Introduce a lock-free RCU-style chain and mempool snapshot (`node::ChainSnapshot` and
`node::MempoolSnapshot`) published via atomic shared pointers so read-heavy RPC handlers
(`getblockchaininfo`, `getmininginfo`, `getmempoolinfo`, `getrawmempool`) can query
consistent chain and mempool state without contending on `cs_main` or `mempool.cs`.
Includes lazy demand-driven mempool snapshot rebuilds via an atomic dirty flag.
